OL,3,GNEWSAOver 200 homes face power cuts due
OL,4,Ato Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 200 homes are without power
OL,7,Fas Storm Boelo hits the North West of
OL,8,FEngland.
OL,10,FThere is a yellow weather warning for
OL,11,Fthe majority of the North West which is
OL,12,Fexpected to remain in place for most of
OL,13,FSunday 25 October.
OL,15,FAccording to Electricity North West's
OL,16,Fwebsite 243 in total across Greater
OL,17,FManchester and Lancashire currently
OL,18,Fhave no power with issues expected to
OL,19,Flast until around 21:00 BST.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
